  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss13:3.12": "The nuns’ offenses entailing suspension 14, 15, 16, and 17 are respectively identical to the monks’ suspension 10 at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss10/en/brahmali#1.3.16.1'>Bu Ss 10:1.3.16.1</a>, 11 at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss11/en/brahmali#1.19.1'>Bu Ss 11:1.19.1</a>, 12 at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss12/en/brahmali#1.26.1'>Bu Ss 12:1.26.1</a>, and 13 at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss13/en/brahmali#1.8.10.1'>Bu Ss 13:1.8.10.1</a>, with appropriate gender changes. ",
